#: kateconsole.cpp:283
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you really want to pipe the text to the console? This will execute any "
"contained commands with your user rights."
msgstr ""
"¿De xuru que quies concatenar el testu cola terminal? Esto va executar, "
"colos tos privilexos, cualesquier comandu que contenga."

