msgstr "Nun ye un ficheru llocal: «%1»"

#: kateconsole.cpp:363
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you really want to Run the document ?\n"
"This will execute the following command,\n"
"with your user rights, in the terminal:\n"
"'%1'"
msgstr ""
"¿De xuru que quies executar el documentu?\n"
"Esto va executar el comandu de darréu na terminal colos tos privilexos "
"actuales:\n"
"«%1»"

